red contexts (`web (Next.js)`, `secrets (gitleaks, full history)`, `dependency review`, CodeQL) cover nothing of these paths. **Say plainly which job covers which branch and what YOUR local runs do and do not substitute for (they are not CI).** CodeQL: nothing is scanned until a PR exists; an alert count of 0 on a ref with no analysis proves nothing: say so. A CodeQL alert OPEN on either head is a STOP for tier 1.

